No fetchState.

fetchState fetched the host's GET /state for dsh-pet's page (client/pet/multi.ts,
not vendored). In A-NAS the page keeps the state store itself and petCard.tsx
reads it, so nothing called it; it goes, with normLeaf, which only it used,
and the import of ROUTE_PATH, which only it read.

